  "content": "<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">waila 提示資訊 嗚嗚....</span></h3><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\">WAILA 提示資訊！111！！！！1！&lt;/span&gt;</span></h3><p>&nbsp;未定義&nbsp;</p><h3 style=\"text-align:center\">waila tooltips 為 1.15.2+ 版本的 Tooltip Creator 整合了 JADE/HWYLA/WTHIT</h3><p>未定義&nbsp;</p><h3 style=\"text-align:center\">它有什麼功能😱😭😱😱🤔🤔🤔🤔🤔🤔</h3><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">Waila Tooltips 讓你可以使用 JADE/HWYLA/WTHIT 查看特定方塊的提示資訊</span></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hwyla\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hwyla：</a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jade\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jade：</a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wthit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">WTHIT：</a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tooltip-creator\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tooltip Creator：</a></span></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">如果有任何問題，歡迎在這裡聯絡我🙃</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">1.15.2：HWYLA</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">1.19.2 FORGE：Jade、WTHIT</span> &nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">1.20.1 FORGE：Jade、WTHIT</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">1.21.1 FORGE：WTHIT</span></p>",
